{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you love rock? Want to become a legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>RockDog</strong> \u2014 a musical RPG where your guitar skills decide everything! In this <strong>demo version</strong>, you\u2019ll get a first taste of the world of RockDog: battle rivals, repeat their riffs, dodge attacks, and make choices that will influence your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo lets you explore several locations, meet some of the key characters, and experience the beginning of the story \u2014 full of friendship, secrets, and betrayal. But remember: nothing is as simple as it seems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P.S. You\u2019re not the main character in this story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s included in the demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core gameplay mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A portion of the story campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual presentation of the game\u2019s style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demonstration of AI-driven rival battles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s not included in the demo (but will be in the full game):</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full story progression and endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wider variety of locations and characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded combat mechanics and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deeper RPG systems and choices</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050540?t=1759409168","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050540/8a85665105603d93009adcebb7414f92ddb51159/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759409168","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050540/ba7f20feabf4c8e5d224f195220633c5df962f49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759409168","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050540/ba7f20feabf4c8e5d224f195220633c5df962f49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759409168","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you love rock? Want to become a legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>RockDog</strong> \u2014 a musical RPG where your guitar skills decide everything! In this <strong>demo version</strong>, you\u2019ll get a first taste of the world of RockDog: battle rivals, repeat their riffs, dodge attacks, and make choices that will influence your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo lets you explore several locations, meet some of the key characters, and experience the beginning of the story \u2014 full of friendship, secrets, and betrayal. But remember: nothing is as simple as it seems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P.S. You\u2019re not the main character in this story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s included in the demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core gameplay mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A portion of the story campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual presentation of the game\u2019s style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demonstration of AI-driven rival battles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s not included in the demo (but will be in the full game):</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full story progression and endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wider variety of locations and characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded combat mechanics and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deeper RPG systems and choices</p></li></ul>","developers":["TempoTech"],"fullgame":{"appid":"40087